@startuml
title UML state machine diagram

[*] --> InitialState : Login
InitialState --> ServiceCenterHome : Display journey details
ServiceCenterHome --> DestinationSelection : User selects destination
DestinationSelection --> JourneyDetailsDisplay : Show journey details
JourneyDetailsDisplay --> DrivingModeActivation : User activates driving mode or chooses other options
DrivingModeActivation --> EatingOption : User is hungry
EatingOption --> PlaceToEatSelection : User selects a place to eat
PlaceToEatSelection --> MenuView : View menu
MenuView --> OrderPlacement : User places an order if they are hungry
OrderPlacement --> Eating : User eats
Eating --> DrivingResumption : Resume driving
DrivingResumption --> AccidentDetection : System detects accident
AccidentDetection --> Notification : System sends notifications during driving or in case of an accident
Notification --> RelevantAuthoritiesInformed : Inform relevant authorities
RelevantAuthoritiesInformed --> PostAccidentNotifications : Send post-accident notifications
PostAccidentNotifications --> FeedbackCollection : Allow users to provide feedback upon completion of their journey
FeedbackCollection --> CompletedJourney : User completes their journey
CompletedJourney --> Logout : User logs out
Logout --> [*] : Logged out Successfully

state InitialState
InitialState : entry / Login
InitialState : do / Display login form
InitialState : exit / User logs in

state ServiceCenterHome
ServiceCenterHome : entry / Logged in Service Center
ServiceCenterHome : do / Display home page
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Enter Damaged parts list
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Expiry Notification page
ServiceCenterHome : exit / Updating Information list

state ExpiryNotification
ExpiryNotification : entry / To view expiry notification
ExpiryNotification : do / Send service request to Car owner
ExpiryNotification : exit / Return to Service center home page

state Entering Damaged parts list
Entering Damaged parts list : entry / To enter Damaged parts list
Entering Damaged parts list : do / Preparing and entering damaged parts list
Entering Damaged parts list : exit / Return to service center home page

state Updating parts Information
Updating parts Information : entry / To update changed parts information
Updating parts Information : do / Update Information
Updating parts Information : exit / Return to Service center home page
@enduml
